<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta carried out a drone strike that damaged a Chinese gas pipeline facility and intensified air attacks on a historic Buddhist meditation centre, a monastery, villages in Sagaing and displacement camps in Rakhine, killing civilians. Iran shipped some LPG and jet fuel despite a blockade, and the Arakan Army seized over 20 soldiers' bodies and weapons in clashes near the Rakhine-Ayeyarwady border. King Charles sent books and letters to detained Aung San Suu Kyi, which the Myanmar government acknowledged. The conflict caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-refugees-find-hope-in-thailand-s-work-program/a-79697921?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQdElSS2xMNmh6Y25COGhRSFVRNUw3azJ0a3pKQ2k5bmxlREh2SXY2ekdwV0JFQlFRblhURER4RWdGVGd3WHh5THN6UmFMcy1VOUoyVk0xaDQ2WmZ5Z3hlNDNxSi00M01tWW9JM0FaQ0trQlQ3VGs3QlNpaVBESUNGclF5WU5pa1lHelgyVlItU2ZraFlMZURSYkxMX05LdFlPOXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBXc05zeFNrSF9Wa3laYVRoRi12OGdLTkEteENlaDZuaDFodC1ENUpsc2VrR09MZGtHMVUtZFU3TXgyOFBkRnVqM3BVTlZENUN0WGd6elhPd2Y3eUlxcXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOekZock9RTTJnZ0d3UkxtUmx0NFZlN1VWc2ZOSndGeTlJTFc0Y1hDTkpBTmRWRHVkMWhNZnUwS1dHOTNYRnl0XzhkZUg2N0I4UDF0aXhsaHMtVlVwNlM1LVlxUzlBdVJMazhhbTlEWjNZUGNWeWxpX0NIaVVpQTlyUjhWQzBoNjBOT2JORnhuYWlTN1hJTTNFclFVLWdmQ1c2UUdZS1hyR3Z3WUU2Ylowdk0yalgxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sky News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNVFdXV3JSQk1EQ1VxSWRjU3M0WU9OWHBRaVBtN3I5NDVQdnpJYzJaRHVlTmJpRUlCc